    "reviews": "\u201c\u00abFor this price I will definitely recommend this game! For a game of this genre, this is very cool done!\u00bb\u201d<br>REKT GAMES<br><br>\u201c\u00abSmall horror game developed by one person. For the price it's worth it, plus the Dev updates the game constantly and is open to feedback. I recommend!\u00bb\u201d<br>Asylum Reviews<br><br>\u201c\u00abFun game to play, the monsters are pretty creepy, so it gets get really scary when they chase you down the halls. \u00bb\u201d<br>Memento Reviews<br>",
